      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/deployment/frameworks/helm.md",
      "patch": "@@ -105,6 +105,7 @@ The following table describes configurable parameters of the chart in `values.ya\n | secrets | object | {} | Secrets configuration |\n | serviceName | string | \"\" | Service name |\n | servicePort | int | 80 | Service port |\n+| shm | object | {\"enabled\":false,\"size\":\"16Gi\"} | Shared memory configuration |\n | labels.environment | string | test | Environment name |\n \n ## Configuration Examples",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/19808bd387eb3f05150d4d8dbedc9768e77af1bc/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fframeworks%2Fhelm.md",
      "sha": "8ef3e5aa4b548ec426fd8e610da03dfae892ee96",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 12,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/19808bd387eb3f05150d4d8dbedc9768e77af1bc/examples%2Fdeployment%2Fchart-helm%2Ftemplates%2Fdeployment.yaml",
      "changes": 12,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/examples%2Fdeployment%2Fchart-helm%2Ftemplates%2Fdeployment.yaml?ref=19808bd387eb3f05150d4d8dbedc9768e77af1bc",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "examples/deployment/chart-helm/templates/deployment.yaml",
      "patch": "@@ -67,6 +67,10 @@ spec:\n           volumeMounts:\n           - name: {{ .Release.Name }}-storage\n             mountPath: /data\n+          {{- if .Values.shm.enabled }}\n+          - name: {{ .Release.Name }}-shm\n+            mountPath: /dev/shm\n+          {{- end }}\n \n         {{- with .Values.extraContainers }}\n         {{ toYaml . | nindent 8 }}\n@@ -106,6 +110,14 @@ spec:\n         - name: {{ .Release.Name }}-storage\n           persistentVolumeClaim:\n             claimName: {{ .Release.Name }}-storage-claim     \n+        {{- if .Values.shm.enabled }}\n+        - name: {{ .Release.Name }}-shm\n+          emptyDir:\n+            medium: Memory\n+            {{- if .Values.shm.size }}\n+            sizeLimit: {{ .Values.shm.size | quote }}\n+            {{- end }}\n+        {{- end }}     \n \n       {{- with .Values.nodeSelector }}\n       nodeSelector:",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/19808bd387eb3f05150d4d8dbedc9768e77af1bc/examples%2Fdeployment%2Fchart-helm%2Ftemplates%2Fdeployment.yaml",
      "sha": "24f0bbcc3b6dcf8997887e95e95af5f99196cb2f",
      "status": "modified"
